Z||000006||Archie||08-23-2001||11:31 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex4mula:<BR><B>Any price figure on beefing up the TH125? More or less? What about a beefing up for a non drag car with about 330HP? TIA.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I believe he charges the same no matter if it's for drag or not. In fact the transmission I have in this car is one of 3 I had him do for me & a couple of my customers'. He does the Torque converters in house too and that is the only difference between this trans hop up and a street hop up.  This trans. has a 3400rpm Convertor, so it will not be very good on the street.<P>He charges like $1100 to beef-up your Trans.<P>Archie<P>I'll post some pics. this weekend.<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 08-23-2001).]||||reg||1
